  'm3.q124': ['Photoluminescent signs soak up light, then glow strongly if the lights fail.', 168],
  'm3.q125': ['Under the PSPA, Class A is the minimum. B, C and D are brighter and glow for longer.', 168],
  'm3.q126': ['Emergency lighting is sub-divided into standby lighting and emergency escape lighting.', 169],
