  'm3.q130': ['High risk task lighting must be enough for dangerous processes to be safely shut down, for example in plant rooms.', 169],
  'm3.q131': ['Typical locations include final exit doors, corridor intersections, changes in floor level, and windowless rooms and toilets.', 170],
  'm3.q132': ['The HM Government fire safety risk assessment guide gives 60m² as the area above which emergency lighting is expected.', 170],
  'm3.q133': ['Self-contained luminaires, each with its own charger, lamp, diffuser and battery, are arguably the most common system.', 170],
